WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:23.170
- [Narrator] This region
of Guizhou, China,

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.050
is famous for its sprawling mountains,

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.266
rivers and massive caves.

00:00:27.266 --> 00:00:30.481
It's here that a little
known ancient Miao tradition

00:00:30.481 --> 00:00:32.225
of cave-based rock climbing is carried on

00:00:32.225 --> 00:00:35.225
by a few locals known as “Spider-Men.”

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.199
This Miao burial tradition faded

00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:49.873
into obscurity and what remained

00:00:49.873 --> 00:00:51.143
was a unique method of collecting

00:00:51.143 --> 00:00:54.066
rare medicinal herbs that
some say remedy diseases

00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:56.603
such as asthma and rheumatism.

00:00:56.603 --> 00:00:59.255
The “Spider-Men,” with their
unparalleled climbing skills,

00:00:59.255 --> 00:01:02.338
are the only people who can get them.

00:02:14.529 --> 00:02:18.279
(upbeat instrumental music)

